<title>USA: United Auto Group to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>United Auto Group to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Auto Group Inc said on Monday its board authorized the repurchase of up to $10 million of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it has about 16.7 million voting common shares outstanding, of which roughly 6.3 million can be currently freely traded.</p>
<p>It said it would use excess cash to fund the repurchase program.</p>
<p>Shares in United Auto closed on Monday at 23-1/2.</p>
